---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
const pageTitle = "Tools"
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <p class="intro">The tools I use to write, organize, and run projects.</p>

  <h3 class="tool"><a href="https://obsidian.com">Obsidian<span class="external-link-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3>
  <p>A local-first knowledge base for notes, research, and project planning.</p>
  <h3 class="tool"><a href="https://linuxmint.com">Linux<span class="external-link-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3>
  <p>My Linux desktop environment and the platform where I do most of my development.</p>
  <h3 class="tool"><a href="https://neovim.io/">Neovim<span class="external-link-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3>
  <p>A fast, keyboard-driven editor for code and configuration.</p>
  <h3 class="tool"><a href="https://github.com/tmux/tmux/wiki">Tmux<span class="external-link-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3>
  <p>A terminal multiplexer for keeping long-running sessions organized.</p>
  <h3 class="tool"><a href="https://i3wm.org/">i3wm <span class="external-link-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3>
  <p>A lightweight tiling window manager that keeps the desktop focused and predictable.</p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>

  .tool a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .tool a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
    background-color: var(--bg);
  }

  .external-link-icon {
    font-size: 1rem;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
</style>
